        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tale of Relm is a turn-based fantasy RPG inspired by the golden age of the FF series. Lead a unique cast of heroes through an exciting, story-rich adventure in a hand-crafted world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Definitive Edition Update Available Now</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring improved visuals, new difficulty options, a fast-travel warp system, extensive bug fixes, and numerous quality-of-life improvements based on player feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/2dd794b222ec1959e104bed89e9702b3.poster.avif?t=1785686584\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/2dd794b222ec1959e104bed89e9702b3.webm?t=1785686584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/2dd794b222ec1959e104bed89e9702b3.mp4?t=1785686584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tale of Destiny and Discovery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the mysterious world of Relm, two souls are bound by fate. Princess Celes, awakening to a powerful legacy, and Edge, a boy who escaped the Crudo program, find their destinies intertwined as they confront the corrupting Black Essence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/8592cbf474634b52f0ae698601494479.avif?t=1785686584\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras_big/8592cbf474634b52f0ae698601494479.webp?t=1785686584 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Discover and Interact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From quiet villages to forgotten temples, exploration is at the heart of Relm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to villagers, uncover secrets, solve puzzles inspired by early Zelda games, and piece together the lore of a world on the edge of collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops, NPCs, and hidden clues breathe life into every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/a245c2df679cfd20f0e81b00202c8dc4.avif?t=1785686584\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras_big/a245c2df679cfd20f0e81b00202c8dc4.webp?t=1785686584 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn’t about grinding - it’s about mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover enemy weaknesses, shatter their defenses, and seize control of battle through a strategic shield-breaking system inspired by classic turn-based RPGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Boss Battles: Every boss has a perfect strategy waiting to be uncovered, rewarding careful observation and tactical thinking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/03ded6b828e070d17f76241f978b2339.poster.avif?t=1785686584\" width=708 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/03ded6b828e070d17f76241f978b2339.webm?t=1785686584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/03ded6b828e070d17f76241f978b2339.mp4?t=1785686584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flexible Character Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Your Party Your Way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A job point system lets you unlock skills in any order, creating countless builds and party combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize every hero - from magic-focused mages to battle-hardened warriors - and define your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/b7b839638ff85e4fbd87a58f929e43c8.avif?t=1785686584\" width=1209 height=677 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Classic JRPG Adventure</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-rich fantasy adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration, puzzles, and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Definitive Edition improvements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/401b6c9fe168dcdde6adeb9f4ffd327c.avif?t=1785686584\" width=1266 height=680 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/f5111926267b8b0f8e904e1a3f39bb0f.poster.avif?t=1785686584\" width=620 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/f5111926267b8b0f8e904e1a3f39bb0f.webm?t=1785686584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/f5111926267b8b0f8e904e1a3f39bb0f.mp4?t=1785686584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
